## 🔮 Design Language Summary for Narravid

| Area | Suggestion |
|------|------------|
| Hero | Full-bleed looping video with blur + CTA in center, gradient glow |
| CTA Buttons | Gradient animated, slight bounce or magnetic effect |
| Sections | Snap transitions, staggered content animation |
| Typography | Minimal but expressive — think clean Apple type + bold section headers |
| Media Previews | Glassmorphism cards or parallax stacking preview cards |
| Testimonials | Floating "cards" with soft entrance animations, avatar + video quote optional |
| Process Flow | Animated numbers, scroll snap, dynamic captions |
| Mobile Feel | Native-feeling transitions, sticky CTA, thumb-friendly toggles |

